<Base title="German Lesson 6: Hobbys" description="Self-paced beginner German lesson 6: Hobbies and free time."><main class="lesson"><a class="back" href="/resources/german-async">← Back to the German learning path</a><p class="eyebrow">GERMAN · A1 · UNIT 1 · LESSON 06</p><h1 lang="de">Hobbys</h1><p class="subtitle">Hobbies and free time</p><p>Talk about what you enjoy doing using simple German sentences.</p><section class="panel"><h2>Watch and listen: Hobbys</h2><p>Watch the video, pause to repeat the hobby vocabulary, and practise describing your own interests.</p><div class="videos"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/288174431?h=f5320feff7" title="German Lesson 6: Hobbies (Vimeo)" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Words and phrases</h2><ul class="vocab"><li><strong>Ich lese gern.</strong><span>I like reading.</span></li><li><strong>Ich spiele Fußball.</strong><span>I play football.</span></li><li><strong>Ich höre gern Musik.</strong><span>I like listening to music.</span></li><li><strong>Was machst du gern?</strong><span>What do you like doing?</span></li></ul></section><section class="panel"><h2>Practise at your own pace</h2><ol><li>Say three hobbies you enjoy using <strong>gern</strong>.</li><li>Ask someone: <strong>Was machst du gern?</strong></li><li>Write two sentences about your free time.</li></ol></section><nav class="lesson-nav"><a href="/resources/german-async">All lessons</a><a href="/resources/german-lesson-7">Next lesson →</a></nav></main></Base><style>.lesson{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:55px 24px 90px;color:#243d35}.back{font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:underline}.eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;margin-top:42px}h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7vw,4.5rem);margin:12px 0}.subtitle{font-size:1.4rem;color:#567047}.lesson>p{line-height:1.7}.panel{margin-top:32px;background:#f7f6ee;border:1px solid #dce1d6;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}h2{font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px}.videos{display:grid;gap:18px}iframe{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border:0;border-radius:12px}.vocab{list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:12px}.vocab li{padding:12px;background:white;border-radius:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}ol{padding-left:22px;line-height:2}.lesson-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-top:30px}.lesson-nav a{color:#304e3d;text-decoration:underline}</style>